  "result": "Excellent! All 47 tests pass. I've added:\n\n**Two new functions to `src/invoices.js`:**\n\n1. **`addLine(invoice, { sku, qty })`** \u2014 adds a line to a draft invoice\n   - If SKU already exists, increases its qty instead of adding duplicate\n   - Enriches new lines with name, unitPrice, and vatRate from catalogue\n   - Validates qty and sku like createInvoice\n\n2. **`removeLine(invoice, sku)`** \u2014 removes a line from a draft invoice\n   - Returns `LINE_NOT_FOUND` if SKU not on invoice\n   - Returns `NO_LINES` if it would remove the last line\n   - Refuses if status isn't 'draft'\n\n**Two new error codes in `src/errors.js`:**\n- `NOT_DRAFT` \u2014 operation only allowed on draft invoices\n- `LINE_NOT_FOUND` \u2014 SKU not found on invoice\n\n**13 new tests** covering:\n- Adding new lines and increasing qty for existing SKUs\n- Product data enrichment\n- Validation (qty, SKU, status)\n- Input immutability\n- Chaining addLine and removeLine operations\n\nBoth functions refuse to modify non-draft invoices and return new objects without mutating input. \u2713",
